## Technologies

The sidebar, overview and hub use the shared `docs-suites.ts` taxonomy. The recategorization script assigns its categories to component frontmatter; `SECTION_ORDER` supplies stable page ordering. Gallery reset uses `DocsGallerySpecimen`, and every new specimen owns its model locally so reset restarts its actual interaction. Source adaptations retain Amicro's MIT attribution and source-file Apache-2.0 notices; preserved Lucide glyph data retains ISC and applicable Feather-MIT notices without a React or Lucide runtime dependency. Shared visibility, reduced-motion and spring behavior belong to TuffEx.
